WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.359
Tyson and the Villains Who Gave Up

00:00:03.009 --> 00:00:07.809
“TOO MUCH FUN!” “WE MUST STOP IT!” “WE'LL CAPTURE TYSON!” “TAG!

00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:09.242
YOU'RE IT!”

00:00:10.092 --> 00:00:13.207
“WHEEE!” “TO THE HIDEOUT!” “BEST RIDE EVER!”

00:00:14.057 --> 00:00:15.491
AT THE HIDEOUT...

00:00:15.741 --> 00:00:17.040
WE HAVE TYSON.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.620
NO FUN ALLOWED.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.240
“TAKE YOUR TIME!” “HE'LL WEAR THEM OUT.”

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:22.964
“TAG!

00:00:23.214 --> 00:00:27.318
YOU'RE IT!” “I'M TOO OLD FOR THIS!” “MY HOSE!” “AGAIN!

00:00:27.568 --> 00:00:28.549
AGAIN!”

00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:34.399
“KNOCK KNOCK!” “WHO'S THERE?” “BANANA!” “BANANA WHO?” “NO MORE BANANAS!”

00:00:35.249 --> 00:00:37.440
“DANCE BATTLE!” “MY CIRCUITS!”

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.214
THE WHOLE BACKYARD IS DANCING!

00:00:41.064 --> 00:00:42.002
“DANCE!

00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:43.170
DANCE!”

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:44.958
“DANCE!

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:46.126
DANCE!”

00:00:46.976 --> 00:00:47.957
“PLEASE!

00:00:48.207 --> 00:00:52.634
TAKE HIM BACK!” “WE GIVE UP!” “BUT WE JUST STARTED!” “NEVER AGAIN!”

00:00:53.484 --> 00:00:57.906
“HOME AT LAST!” “BEST DAY EVER!” “THAT WAS FAST!” “PLEASE...

00:00:58.156 --> 00:00:59.505
NEVER COME BACK.”

00:01:00.355 --> 00:01:03.006
“SEE YOU TOMORROW!” “no more tag...”
